WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.449
Major arcana XIX to XXI cover clarity,
calling and completion.

00:00:05.449 --> 00:00:10.314
Here is what each tarot card traditionally
means, upright and reversed.

00:00:11.614 --> 00:00:12.156
The Sun.

00:00:12.156 --> 00:00:17.575
A child rides a white horse beneath a
bright sun, with sunflowers behind a wall.

00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:19.811
Joy, vitality, clarity, optimism.

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:21.751
Judgement.

00:00:21.751 --> 00:00:26.809
An angel sounds a trumpet while figures
rise from their coffins with arms open.

00:00:26.809 --> 00:00:30.202
Reflection, reckoning, calling,
forgiveness, renewal.

00:00:31.602 --> 00:00:34.010
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:38.893
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
